        "zh" : "\u5F88\u597D\u3002\u6211\u4EEC\u4FBF\u5C06\u6C5D\u4E4B\u6050\u60E7\u643A\u8D70\uFF0C\u6EBA\u4E8E\u6C34\u5E95\u3002\n\n\u7FA4\u72FC\u89C6\u4E4B\u4E0D\u8FC7\u5982\u5154\uFF0C\u5CED\u58C1\u671B\u4E4B\u4EA6\u4E0D\u903E\u7F13\u4E18\u3002\n\n\n\n<b>\u6050\u60E7\u4E4B\u5951\u5DF2\u7ACB</b>",
        "en" : "Good. We will take your fear and drown it in the water then.\n\nThe wolves will seem no larger than rabbits. The cliffs no steeper than gentle hills.\n\n\n\n<b>FEAR BARGAIN STRUCK</b>",
        "ja" : "Good. We will take your fear and drown it in the water then.\n\nThe wolves will seem no larger than rabbits. The cliffs no steeper than gentle hills.\n\n\n\n<b>FEAR BARGAIN STRUCK</b>"
