    {
      "Line" : {
        "zh" : "\u5176\u4E0D\u613F\u968F\u6211\u7B49\u800C\u53BB\u3002\n\n\u5584\u54C9\u3002\u90A3\u6211\u4EEC\u4FBF\u4F7F\u5176\u6C38\u5C5E\u6C5D\u8EAB\u2014\u2014\u4E00\u5C0F\u7C07\u5FE0\u8150\uFF0C\u5E38\u4F34\u4E0D\u79BB\u3002\n\n\u5B83\u5C06\u508D\u6C5D\u5DE6\u53F3\uFF0C\u4EE4\u8BF8\u822C\u8D2A\u75BE\u65E0\u4EE5\u5BD3\u4E8E\u6C5D\u4F53\u3002\n\n\n\n<b>\u5EB7\u5065\u4E4B\u5951\u5DF2\u7ACB</b>",
        "en" : "It does not wish to leave with us.\n\nVery well. Then we shall make it yours forever. A small and faithful rot.\n\nIt will linger at your side and keep the hungrier sicknesses from finding a home within you.\n\n\n\n<b>HEALTH BARGAIN STRUCK</b>",
        "ja" : "It does not wish to leave with us.\n\nVery well. Then we shall make it yours forever. A small and faithful rot.\n\nIt will linger at your side and keep the hungrier sicknesses from finding a home within you.\n\n\n\n<b>HEALTH BARGAIN STRUCK</b>"
